# 📝 Python To-Do List Application

A simple and enhanced command-line To-Do List application built using Python.  
This project allows users to manage their daily tasks efficiently through a terminal interface.

## 🚀 Features

- Add new tasks
- View all tasks
- Delete tasks
- Mark tasks as completed
- Persistent storage using JSON
- Error handling for invalid inputs

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- JSON
- Command Line Interface (CLI)

## 📂 Project Structure

todo-list/
│
├── todo.py
├── tasks.json
└── README.md

